r\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230824232422&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pythius_the_Rotten_58594e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Pythius the Rotten.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a> caves.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Pythius and his treasure\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"264\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pythius_Treasure_707df7.png\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Pythius and his treasure</p> </figcaption> </figure>Pythius the Rotten is an undead dragon living in <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a> caves. He claims to have obtained his treasure from the civilization of <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a> when their downfall began. You may challenge him as a part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a> if you have completed the <a href=\"#/quest/the-queen-of-the-banshees-quest\">The Queen of the Banshees Quest</a> or at least received the kiss from the banshee queen. If you accept his challenge you can then access the teleporter next to him that leads to the dragon lord lair if you give him something for his treasure.\n<p>Part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest"],"pos":{"x":32589,"y":31407,"z":15}}